    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>5. Continuous Benchmarking & Shadow Evaluation (`grooveli-ai-lab`)</h2>
<p>To continuously test newer, cheaper, or higher-quality AI models without risking user experience, Grooveli utilizes a <strong>Background Shadow Evaluation</strong> model.</p>

<h3>Shadow Testing Process</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Phase</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Action</th>
      <th style="width: 40%;">Impact on System</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>1. Primary Generation</strong></td>
      <td>User requests audio synthesis; Primary Model generates and returns audio immediately.</td>
      <td>100% active UX speed. Zero added user delay.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>2. Async Shadow Call</strong></td>
      <td>Background worker sends the exact same prompt to a candidate evaluation model.</td>
      <td>Runs entirely in detached background worker.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>3. Metric Logging</strong></td>
      <td>Logs response latency, audio quality score (MOS), and wholesale cost to database.</td>
      <td>Builds real-world empirical comparison data.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>4. Automated Migration</strong></td>
      <td>If candidate model proves 95%+ quality at 50%+ lower cost over 1,000 requests, trigger provider migration.</td>
      <td>Reduces operating costs automatically over time.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>6. Implementation Roadmap & Milestones</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Phase</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Milestone Focus</th>
      <th style="width: 40%;">Primary Deliverables</th>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Target Timeline</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Phase 1</strong></td>
      <td>Core Architecture & Billing</td>
      <td>• Abstraction Provider Architecture<br>• Credit Pre-Lock & Settlement Billing Engine<br>• Automated Circuit Breaker Failover System</td>
      <td><strong>Week 1 – 2</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Phase 2</strong></td>
      <td>Studio Module Rollout</td>
      <td>• Lyric & Co-Writer Assistant (Real-Time Text Stream)<br>• Voice Clone Studio Integration<br>• Vocal Stem Separator & AI Mastering Engine<br>• Beat & Track Generator</td>
      <td><strong>Week 3 – 5</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Phase 3</strong></td>
      <td>Shadow Mode & Self-Hosting</td>
      <td>• grooveli-ai-lab Background Evaluation Suite<br>• Self-Hosted Voice/Audio Models on Serverless GPUs</td>
      <td><strong>Week 6 – 7</strong></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>7. Strategic Recommendations for Executive Sign-off</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Approve Blueprint v2.0</strong> as the standard architectural specification for Grooveli AI Studio integrations.</li>
  <li><strong>Prioritize the Provider Abstraction Layer</strong> to ensure all 6 modules remain vendor-agnostic from day one.</li>
  <li><strong>Enforce Credit Billing Guardrails</strong> prior to request dispatching to guarantee minimum 80% gross profit margins across all generative tools.</li>
</ol>

